   DSB-K224001 COMPLETED
   RPY-K224001-1 COMPLETED
   RPY-K224001-2 COMPLETED
   RPY-K224001-3 COMPLETED
   loan LN-2026-000048

== Seeding the other outcomes deliberately
   MISSING_IN_ERP: repayment MISS-ERP-224001 posted straight into Fineract (e.g. from the Fineract UI)
   MISSING_IN_FINERACT: manual journal entry MISS-FIN-224001 posted straight into the ERP
   AMOUNT_MISMATCH: MISMATCH-224001 is 100000 in Fineract but 90000 in the ERP
   Reversal: RPY-K224001-2 reversed in Fineract after it was posted to the ERP (Fineract then re-splits RPY-K224001-3)
   fineract: {"resourceId":205}
   fineract manuallyReversed: true

