== Explicit, idempotent repairs
   POST /api/reconciliation/repairs {external_reference: MISS-ERP-224001}
   -> action=posted_to_erp status=MATCHED
   POST /api/reconciliation/repairs {external_reference: MISS-ERP-224001}
   -> action=none status=MATCHED
   POST /api/reconciliation/repairs {external_reference: RPY-K224001-2}
   -> action=posted_reversal_to_erp status=MATCHED
   POST /api/reconciliation/repairs {external_reference: RPY-K224001-2}
   -> action=none status=MATCHED
   POST /api/reconciliation/repairs {external_reference: MISMATCH-224001}
   -> REPAIR_NOT_SUPPORTED: AMOUNT_MISMATCH needs manual review: no automatic repair is safe
   POST /api/reconciliation/repairs {external_reference: MISS-FIN-224001}
   -> REPAIR_NOT_SUPPORTED: MISSING_IN_FINERACT needs manual review: no automatic repair is safe

